00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:24.590
Preservation and
production in the Bay Area.

00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:30.368
&gt;&gt; Great, well, a wonderful and
eclectic group of panelists here, so

00:13:30.368 --> 00:13:34.620
