I went to undergraduate at Brown,

00:14:00.635 --> 00:14:06.020
which I think I share that
with another panelists.

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:11.450
Yeah, and you have full freedom
which is kind of scary at Brown,

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:16.490
there's no set majors
there's no core curriculum.

00:14:16.490 --> 00:14:20.999
And I didn't take an econ math
investing fine, like none of it,

00:14:20.999 --> 00:14:25.256
none of those things,
I was fully focused on public health,

00:14:25.256 --> 00:14:30.430
