00:14:39.395 --> 00:14:44.427
I realized pretty quickly that
in order to get things done that

00:14:44.427 --> 00:14:50.135
I really cared about at the local level,
having more of that finance,

00:14:50.135 --> 00:14:54.229
real estate and negotiations,
business [LAUGH].

00:14:54.229 --> 00:14:59.644
